SUMMARY:The Ever After Garden
DESCRIPTION:Thirty thousand illuminated white roses\, each dedicated to s
 omeone who has died\, fill Duke of York Square. Walking through is free\
 ; dedications support the Royal Marsden.\nPrice: Free to walk through. D
 edicating a rose starts at a suggested £15 minimum donation\nhttps://ww
 w.royalmarsden.org/ever-after-garden
LOCATION:Duke of York Square\, Duke of York Square\, Chelsea\, London SW3
  4LY\, Chelsea\, London
URL:https://www.royalmarsden.org/ever-after-garden
END:VEVENT
